        <headline>Warning to Sheep Graziers for Central, West and South Gippsland and East Gippsland forecast districts</headline>
        <description>Sheep graziers are warned that cold temperatures, showers and westerly winds are expected during Wednesday. Areas likely to be affected include parts of the Central, West and South Gippsland and East Gippsland forecast districts. There is a risk of losses of lambs and sheep exposed to these conditions.</description>
